view formula-comparative-quantities | comparative-quantity | ratio,rate,unit-rate,proportion,percentage,relative-change,percentage-point-difference | formula | Comparative Quantities | tables/formulas/comparative-quantities.md | These relations all use comparison, division, scaling, or difference. Their meaning depends on ordered roles, quantity kinds, units, baseline, and domain restrictions.
